# ============================================================================
#  DIMITRY — WHITELIST .gitignore   (safety-first)
#
#  Posture: IGNORE EVERYTHING, then explicitly ALLOW only code/apps/docs that
#  have been verified to contain NO personal or financial data. This repo is a
#  CODE backup — your vault (notes, analyses, beliefs, fills, journal, account
#  screenshots, balances) never leaves your machine.
#
#  Rule: a file is published ONLY if it is un-ignored below. When in doubt, it
#  stays private. To add a new safe file, add a matching `!` line.
# ============================================================================

# 1) ignore every file, everywhere …
*
# 2) … but let git DESCEND into directories so the allows below can reach nested files
!*/

# always-deny, even if a broad allow is added later
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*_token*
*secret*
*credentials*
*.ndjson
beliefs.json
users.json
node_modules/
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  ALLOWED — the engine (pure logic, no personal data)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE

!/50_Training/Tools/dimitry-server/*.js
!/50_Training/Tools/dimitry-server/watchers/*.js
!/50_Training/Tools/dimitry-server/rules/*.js
!/50_Training/Tools/dimitry-server/calibration/*.js
!/50_Training/Tools/dimitry-server/replay/*.js

# PWA + launch assets (no data)
!/50_Training/Tools/dimitry-server/manifest.webmanifest
!/50_Training/Tools/dimitry-server/sw.js
!/50_Training/Tools/dimitry-server/icon.svg
!/50_Training/Tools/dimitry-server/*.md
!/50_Training/Tools/dimitry-server/*.bat
!/50_Training/Tools/dimitry-server/*.vbs
!/50_Training/Tools/dimitry-server/users.example.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  ALLOWED — the mobile app (pure renderer, embeds no data) + docs
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!/50_Training/Tools/Dimitry Mobile.html
!/50_Training/Tools/Dimitry Mobile — UI-UX Guide.md
!/50_Training/Tools/Dimitry — UI-UX Design System.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  RE-DENIED — carve-outs INSIDE allowed folders that DO hold real results.
#  (Order matters: these come after the allows, so they win.)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/50_Training/Tools/dimitry-server/calibration/scorecard-data.js
/50_Training/Tools/dimitry-server/calibration/self-model-data.js
/50_Training/Tools/dimitry-server/calibration/labelled-events.js
/50_Training/Tools/dimitry-server/seed-beliefs.js

#  Explicitly NEVER published (belt-and-suspenders — already covered by `*`):
#   • Dimitry Dashboard.html  ← embeds live account balances / positions
#   • *.ndjson, beliefs.json, reconciliation.json, process-leaks.json,
#     base-rates.json, self-model.json, adjudication.json
#   • _attachments/**  (MT5 / position screenshots)
#   • every vault note, analysis, knowledge, prop and review folder
